sequenceDiagram
 participant A as PEP or gateway
 participant V as Vault
 participant R as Synthetic rotator
 A->>V: Narrow AppRole login
 V-->>A: 60 second token, dedicated policy
 A->>V: Read KV v2 gateway path
 V-->>A: Current approved credential and version
 A->>V: Revoke self
 R->>V: CAS update gateway credential
 A->>V: Next request reads new version
